{
  "": "UnsupportedJurisdictionError: StrataVerze has no strata rules for this state yet, so this building cannot be managed here. Buildings can be in: New South Wales, Queensland.",
  "ACT": "UnsupportedJurisdictionError: StrataVerze has no strata rules for ACT yet, so this building cannot be managed here. Buildings can be in: New South Wales, Queensland.",
  "VIC": "UnsupportedJurisdictionError: StrataVerze has no strata rules for VIC yet, so this building cannot be managed here. Buildings can be in: New South Wales, Queensland.",
  "WA": "UnsupportedJurisdictionError: StrataVerze has no strata rules for WA yet, so this building cannot be managed here. Buildings can be in: New South Wales, Queensland.",
  "XX": "UnsupportedJurisdictionError: StrataVerze has no strata rules for XX yet, so this building cannot be managed here. Buildings can be in: New South Wales, Queensland.",
}
`;
